menu "Debug Engine"

    config WIRELESS_DEBUG_RESERVE_RAM
        bool "Reserve PSRAM pool for wireless-debug transport"
        default y
        depends on SPIRAM
        help
            Carve out a static pool from external PSRAM at boot and never free
            it. Intended for the future DAP-over-WiFi packet transport buffers
            (so a large inbound DAP stream never competes with internal DRAM
            used by the IRAM bit-bang code and the USB/WiFi stacks).

    config WIRELESS_DEBUG_RESERVE_RAM_SIZE_KB
        int "Reserved pool size (KB)"
        default 512
        range 64 4096
        depends on WIRELESS_DEBUG_RESERVE_RAM
        help
            Size of the reserved external-PSRAM pool in KB.

endmenu
